<%# locals: (verdict:) %>
<% if verdict.requirements.empty? && !verdict.training_signups_allowed %>
  <dl class="instruction-list">
    <dt>Why can't I sign up for this session?</dt>
    <dd>
      Completion of the Online Course is required before signing up for any In-Person Training. This requirement
      does not apply to Advanced Ranger Trainings (ART).
    </dd>

    <dt>Can I sign up for shifts now?</dt>
    <dd>
      Yes, shifts may be signed up for in advance. You must attend and pass the required In-Person Training before
      you are permitted to be on duty, and certain positions also require an Advanced Ranger Training (ART).
    </dd>

    <dt>I finished the Online Course. Why does it not show?</dt>
    <dd>
      The Clubhouse may take up to 30 minutes to display completion. If more than two hours have passed and your
      status has not updated, contact the Training Academy at <%= mail_to EmailAddresses::TRAINING_ACADEMY %>.
    </dd>
  </dl>
<% else %>
  <p>
    Before the shift can be signed up for, the following issue(s) must be fixed first:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-bulleted">
    <% verdict.requirements.each do |req| %>
      <li><%= Scheduling::REQUIREMENT_LABELS[req].html_safe %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
<% end %>
